+//! `ReserveContinuityKey` and `ReleaseContinuityKey` over a real `service_session_v3` connection to
+//! an in-process daemon (ht-ma6i.8): owner authorization, operation-key replay and payload-mismatch
+//! refusal through the session, and an already-running clone's seat gaining a key. The fixture host
+//! is unavailable, so no reconciliation touches the seeded seats.
+
